# Security AppSec (Auto)

Conflict ဖြစ်ရင် `00-core-fsm` Safety **ဦးစားပေး**။  
ဤ file = SharePoint-concrete digest။

---

## Secrets (လျှို့ဝှက်ချက်များ)

- Credentials, API keys, tokens, tenant IDs, connection strings **hardcode မလုပ်**
- `.env` / tenant secrets **commit မလုပ်**
- Passwords, tokens, session identifiers **log မထုတ်**

---

## Input / Output (ဝင်ထွက်)

- Input **sanitize**; output **escape** (HTML attribute/text/URL contexts)
- `eval`, unchecked `innerHTML` / `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` with user data, shell `exec` on user data **မသုံး**
- raw HTML injection ထက် textContent / safe DOM APIs **prefer**

---

## AuthZ (Authorization)

- Data R/W = list/item permissions — AuthN success alone **မလုံလောက်** (IDOR)
- custom in-page auth ထက် host SharePoint auth / existing services **prefer**
- admin/script surfaces = **least privilege**

---

## Dependencies

- Package အသစ် user approval (`00` Dependencies)
- Data SoT ဤ repo = **`SPHttpClient`**
- `@pnp/sp` = **ask-first only**

---

## PII (Personally Identifiable Information)

- user names, emails, scores, participant identity = **sensitive**
- front-end globals, HTML comments, chat dumps မှာ PII **မထုတ်**

---

## Do not (မလုပ်ရ)

- security ကို "ပို mild ဖြစ်အောင်" ပြောဖို့ **အားလျော့ မလုပ်**
- production secrets touch / Local/tenant credentials replies မှာ **expose မလုပ်**
